   "heading": "Skip fretting",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Skip fretting system 81 7 20 is a skip fretting system for 81edo . All examples on this page are for 7-string guitar .\n1/1: string 2 open\n2/1: string 5 fret 3\n3/2: string 4 fret 1 and string 7 fret 4\n5/4: string 7 fret 1\n7/4: string 3 fret 18\n11/8: string 3 fret 14\n13/8: string 1 fret 11 and string 4 fret 14"
  },
